OL,3,GNEWSA'Utter contempt' for human life
OL,4,Ashown in deadly arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn arson attack in Waterford which
OL,7,Fresulted in the death of four family
OL,8,Fmembers, including two children, showed
OL,9,F"utter contempt" for human life, the
OL,10,FDail (Irish parliament) has heard.
OL,12,FKim English, Philip English and their
OL,13,Fchildren, 12-year-old Callum and
OL,14,Fnine-year-old Jayden, died in the house
OL,15,Ffire on Birch Avenue, on the outskirts
OL,16,Fof Waterford in the Republic of Ireland
OL,17,Fon Tuesday.
OL,19,FIrish broadcaster RTE has reported that
OL,20,Fdetectives believe the attack is linked
OL,21,Fto organised crime and drugs-related
OL,22,Fintimidation.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
